 AS SACRISTAN, HE WAS A REGULAR PARTICIPANT IN THE EUCHARISTIC CELEBRATIONS FROM ELEMENTARY DAYS TO HIGH SCHOOL  DAYS AND UP TO COLLEGE DAYS IN U.P. DILIMAN; 

